# Superpowers (Cursor plugin)

This project documents full expectations in `AGENTS.md`. In short:

- Install the **Superpowers** plugin if you use Cursor’s agent for this codebase.
- Invoke relevant skills **before** heavy work when applicable: **brainstorming** (new features/behavior), **systematic-debugging** (bugs), **test-driven-development** (implementation with tests), **verification-before-completion** (before claiming done or opening PRs).
- User and project instructions override skill defaults when they conflict.
